{"unit_id":"reina4xa__dsh-plugin-reload#card-zh","repo":"reina4xa/dsh-plugin-reload","commit":"0727b6a45d5475af7799d0b1245482787c195739","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-reload 是面向 DSH agent 的插件重载工具。它注册 reload_plugin，可按条目 ID、模块名或 MCP serverName 定位单个 Loader 条目，并支持 dry run 预览。MCP 客户端通过重启 fiber 重新启动服务；进程内插件则清理本地 ESM/CJS 缓存并重新导入代码，失败时尝试恢复旧模块。适合需要单独更新插件而不重启主机的场景。需要 DSH、Cordis Loader 和 dsh-tools；硬重载需 Node 内部模块加载器访问。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:430-469","src/index.ts:470-546","src/index.ts:304-425"]}
{"unit_id":"reina4xa__dsh-plugin-reload#card-en","repo":"reina4xa/dsh-plugin-reload","commit":"0727b6a45d5475af7799d0b1245482787c195739","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-reload adds a DSH tool for reloading one plugin entry by ID, module name, or MCP serverName. It can preview the target. MCP entries restart their server; in-process plugins reload local code, with rollback attempts on failure. Hard reload needs internal Node loader access.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:430-469","src/index.ts:470-546","src/index.ts:304-425"]}
